Description: Specify CLI - bootstrap projects for Spec-Driven Development
 Specify CLI is part of GitHub Spec Kit. It sets up the directory structure,
 templates and AI coding agent integrations needed to practice Spec-Driven
 Development (SDD), where clear specifications are written before
 implementation.
